Worktrees
    (Can do anything but can't work on a branch that is being used by another worktree)

.git/worktrees - Dir that helps the main worktree keep track of the others.

git worktree list

git worktree add path branchnm; branchnm is the name given to the branch that represents the linked worktree.

git worktree remove wtname
    OR
rm -rf path; git worktree prune

